//! tr kodlu 2 dil=en
// Error 08 — Missing argument.
// Message code: H2414
// What happens: While the program runs, a call with a missing argument raises an error that names it.
// Why: add() wants two parameters but one was given.
// Fixed version:
//     print(add(1, 2)) // or: func add(a, b = 0)
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/08_missing_argument.tr   (exit code 1)

A020 add(a, b) {
    A021 a + b
}
G100(add(1))
